# JustAC hand pin, WoW Forever: Restoration Druid damage (levelling, or nothing to heal). The
# sim list source (tools/forever-apl-src) models no healer. Order: Icy Veins' Forever
# Restoration Druid levelling guide (read 2026-11-17): keep Moonfire and, once talented,
# Insect Swarm up, then Wrath as the filler.
# Supported conditions: target.health.pct<N, [!]dot.X.ticking, active_enemies>=N.

actions=moonfire,if=!dot.moonfire.ticking
actions+=/insect_swarm,if=!dot.insect_swarm.ticking
actions+=/wrath
